+-- =============================================================================
+-- ThriveAtHome — Database Assertion Queries
+-- Run against: Supabase ref qdniskppkfqjmtpkftdt
+-- Usage: psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f tests/db/assertions.sql
+-- Or via: npx tsx tests/db/run-assertions.ts
